! LiquidCooling_9_6MW_1Cluster_CoolingTower_S45_W40.idf
! 1-cluster system-only reference model for a 9.6 MW liquid-cooled data hall.
! The cluster has one coolant loop, one condenser-water loop, one CDU HX, and one cooling tower.
! Operating basis: S45 / W40 with a 30% propylene glycol coolant loop.

